    \caption{\small \textbf{The proposed framework of RSEND.} Our network consists of five subnets: a Decom-Net, a Dark Region Detection-Net, an Enhancer-Net, a Refinement-Net, and a Denoiser. The Decom-Net decomposes the low-light image into a reflectance map and an illumination map based on the Retinex theory. The Dark Region Detection-Net means to find the regions that need to be enhanced more. The Enhancer-Net functions to illuminate the illumination map. The Refinement-Net aims to adjust contrasts and fine-tune the details. In the end, Denoiser performs denoising to get clean and visually pleasing output.}
